{"page":"SMARCE1","gene":"SMARCE1","accession":"Q969G3","protein":"SWI/SNF-related matrix-associated actin-dependent regulator of chromatin subfamily E member 1","length":411,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q969G3-1","name":"1","synonyms":["BAF57"],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000348513.12","ENST00000643683.1","ENST00000951586.1"],"refseq":["NM_003079.5"],"refseqProteins":["NP_003070.3"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q969G3-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q969G3-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":69.5,"plddt":[[50,1],[0,1],[50,12],[0,15],[50,2],[0,2],[50,1],[0,14],[50,1],[0,1],[50,7],[70,8],[90,83],[70,15],[50,13],[0,1],[50,9],[70,6],[90,11],[70,1],[90,1],[70,19],[90,45],[70,1],[90,2],[70,4],[50,4],[70,8],[90,14],[70,1],[90,1],[70,10],[50,2],[0,82],[50,7],[0,6]]}},"features":[{"type":"Cross-link","start":3,"end":3,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":4,"end":4,"description":"Omega-N-methylarginine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":40,"end":40,"description":"Omega-N-methylarginine"},{"type":"DNA binding","start":66,"end":134,"description":"HMG box"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":92,"end":92,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO1); alternate"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":92,"end":92,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2); alternate"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":131,"end":131,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":146,"end":146,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":166,"end":166,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"},{"type":"Coiled coil","start":220,"end":319,"description":""},{"type":"Modified residue","start":265,"end":265,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":277,"end":277,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in SUMO2)"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Component of the multiprotein chromatin-remodeling complexes SWI/SNF: SWI/SNF-A (BAF), SWI/SNF-B (PBAF) and related complexes. The canonical complex contains a catalytic subunit (either SMARCA4/BRG1/BAF190A or SMARCA2/BRM/BAF190B), and at least SMARCE1, ACTL6A/BAF53, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCC2/BAF170, and SMARCB1/SNF5/BAF47. Other subunits specific to each of the complexes may also be present permitting several possible combinations developmentally and tissue specific (PubMed:12672490, PubMed:22952240, PubMed:26601204). Component of the BAF complex, which includes at least actin (ACTB), ARID1A/BAF250A, ARID1B/BAF250B, SMARCA2/BRM/BAF190B, SMARCA4/BRG1/BAF190A, ACTL6A/BAF53, ACTL6B/BAF53B, SMARCE1/BAF57, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCC2/BAF170, SMARCB1/SNF5/INI1, and one or more SMARCD1/BAF60A, SMARCD2/BAF60B, or SMARCD3/BAF60C. In muscle cells, the BAF complex also contains DPF3 (PubMed:18765789). Component of neural progenitors-specific chromatin remodeling complex (npBAF complex) composed of at least, ARID1A/BAF250A or ARID1B/BAF250B, SMARCD1/BAF60A, SMARCD3/BAF60C, SMARCA2/BRM/BAF190B, SMARCA4/BRG1/BAF190A, SMARCB1/BAF47, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCE1/BAF57, SMARCC2/BAF170, PHF10/BAF45A, ACTL6A/BAF53A and actin. Component of neuron-specific chromatin remodeling complex (nBAF complex) composed of at least, ARID1A/BAF250A or ARID1B/BAF250B, SMARCD1/BAF60A, SMARCD3/BAF60C, SMARCA2/BRM/BAF190B, SMARCA4/BRG1/BAF190A, SMARCB1/BAF47, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCE1/BAF57, SMARCC2/BAF170, DPF1/BAF45B, DPF3/BAF45C, ACTL6B/BAF53B and actin. May be a component of the SWI/SNF-B (PBAF) chromatin remodeling complex, at least composed of SMARCA4/BRG1, SMARCB1/BAF47/SNF5, ACTL6A/BAF53A or ACTL6B/BAF53B, SMARCE1/BAF57, SMARCD1/BAF60A, SMARCD2/BAF60B, perhaps SMARCD3/BAF60C, SMARCC1/BAF155, SMARCC2/BAF170, PBRM1/BAF180, ARID2/BAF200 and actin (ACTB) (PubMed:22952240, PubMed:26601204). Interacts with BRDT (By similarity). Also binds to the SRC/p160 family of histone acetyltransferases (HATs) composed of NCOA1, NCOA2, and NCOA3. Interacts with RCOR1/CoREST, NR3C1 and ZMIM2/ZIMP7 (PubMed:12192000, PubMed:12917342, PubMed:16051670)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q969G3-2","name":"2","synonyms":["BAF57v"],"notes":[],"length":363,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000264640.9","ENST00000447024.6","ENST00000644701.1"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,343]],"edits":[{"start":344,"end":411,"original":"ETHLEETTESQQNGEEGTSTPEDKESGQEGVDSMAEEGTS","replacement":"KNCQLCPRKTLTSRYTDFPD","added":20}],"missing":68,"replaced":0,"novel":20,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q969G3-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q969G3-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":73.3,"plddt":[[0,4],[50,11],[0,14],[50,2],[0,2],[50,1],[0,14],[50,1],[0,2],[50,6],[70,9],[90,78],[70,2],[90,1],[70,18],[50,4],[0,1],[50,16],[70,9],[90,7],[70,9],[50,1],[70,2],[50,5],[70,5],[90,45],[70,1],[90,2],[70,4],[50,4],[70,8],[90,14],[70,1],[90,2],[70,1],[90,1],[70,7],[50,2],[0,45],[50,1],[0,1]],"losingConfidence":0}},{"accession":"Q969G3-3","name":"3","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":341,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000578044.6","ENST00000643318.1"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,71,341]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":70,"original":"MSKRPSYAPPPTPAPATQMPSTPGFVGYNPYSHLAYNNYR","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":70,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":13,"foldedMissing":13,"features":[[0,1,0],[1,1,0],[2,1,0],[3,5,0]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q969G3-3-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q969G3-3-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":74.3,"plddt":[[70,1],[90,87],[70,8],[50,20],[70,6],[90,1],[70,2],[90